          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the straight and silent movement at 20m (65.6 ft) above ground of an oval, gray metallic object reflecting sunlight and a sudden disappearance: observation of a metallic nylon balloon, type \"Mylar\".",
          "translation_text_sha256": "84830e1bcfed7c7721d7d8446f205f49d6dab5eb0c37932ca8985129be2fad56"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
